    "title": "Free Summer Concert Series Returns to Downtown Rome This Season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WKTV ,\n9 hours ago ROME, N.Y. -- Live music and summer festivities are returning to downtown Rome with the Gigs on the Green concert series. According to the City of Rome, the free events will take place at the new Griffo Green on Wednesdays and feature performances by local favorites including Ryan Quinn on June 17, Showtime on Aug. 5, Isaac French on Aug. 19 and Last Left on Sept. 16. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
